      <Variable name="Age at entry" type="numeric" role="chance">
        <Comment><![CDATA[<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p style="margin-top: 0">
      Age of the patient when entering the model, i.e., when the hip is 
      replaced by a prosthesis.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 0">
      
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 0">
      The Delta probability potential associated to this node implies that the 
      patient (in the reference case) is 60 years when entering the model.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>]]></Comment>
